    m_TableEntryReference:
      m_KeyId: 0
      m_Key: 'DESKTOP TESTING

        WASD walk / mouse look / click grab or release.

        E
        use / Q drop / scroll reach / R rotate.

        Hold E with the sponge aimed
        at a dish to scrub.

        Tab frees the cursor for buttons; 1 / 2 / 3
        answer the quiz.'
